["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/cwe", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[Common Weakness Enumeration](https://csrc.nist.gov/glossary/term/common_weakness_enumeration). A reference to a source of software flaws defined within the official [CWE List](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/) that conforms to the [CWE specification](https://cwe.mitre.org/).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N53e7e8727b3f4b87a8f5e1888b6a7dc2", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message", "When relationship is hasInstall, to must be an Artifact", "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "", ""]
